The  driver  provides support for the PC87366 LPC Super I/O.  The
Super I/O incorporates several  logical  devices,  the  following
ones  are  supported: GPIO, VLM and TMS.  The GPIO logical device
provides 29 I/O pins which can be accessed through the framework.
The program allows easy manipulation of the pins  from  userland.
